{"seq":5,"slug":"building-language-servers","title":"构建语言服务器","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/editors-compilers/lsp-and-dev-tools/building-language-servers","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"server-architecture","title":"服务器架构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/editors-compilers/lsp-and-dev-tools/building-language-servers/server-architecture","wordCount":1089,"readingTime":5},{"seq":2,"slug":"typescript-language-server","title":"TypeScript 语言服务器","url":"/l-doc-books/h/editors-compilers/lsp-and-dev-tools/building-language-servers/typescript-language-server","wordCount":650,"readingTime":3},{"seq":3,"slug":"rust-analyzer-patterns","title":"Rust Analyzer 模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/editors-compilers/lsp-and-dev-tools/building-language-servers/rust-analyzer-patterns","wordCount":1096,"readingTime":5},{"seq":4,"slug":"testing-language-servers","title":"测试语言服务器","url":"/l-doc-books/h/editors-compilers/lsp-and-dev-tools/building-language-servers/testing-language-servers","wordCount":1026,"readingTime":5}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"构建语言服务器-简介\">构建语言服务器 简介</h1><p>从理解 LSP 规范到实际构建一个语言服务器，中间隔着架构设计、增量分析、测试策略等一系列工程挑战。本章将带你走完从零到一构建语言服务器的完整路径。</p>\n<p>本章将带你深入四个核心主题：</p>\n<p><strong>服务器架构</strong>讲解语言服务器的整体生命周期设计，包括增量分析策略、工作区索引、项目模型和配置管理等核心架构决策。</p>\n<p><strong>TypeScript 语言服务器</strong>通过 vscode-languageserver-node 框架实战，涵盖 TextDocuments 助手、各类请求处理器和客户端测试。</p>\n<p><strong>Rust Analyzer 模式</strong>深入 rust-analyzer 的架构设计——基于 Salsa 的需求驱动增量计算、虚拟文件系统、请求取消和 Chalk 类型推断。</p>\n<p><strong>测试语言服务器</strong>覆盖协议级测试、Mock 客户端、快照测试、一致性测试和性能基准测试等完整的测试策略。</p>\n<p>建议从服务器架构开始，建立整体认知后再选择 TypeScript 或 Rust 实现路径深入。</p>\n"}